{"schema":"rebang.page/1","platform":"weibo","key":"h-1cc4e59dd3","page":1,"pages":1,"total":10,"has_more":false,"items":[{"id":"weibo-1906286443:5367036576008544","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"weibo-1906286443","source_name":"钟文泽","title":"","summary":"今日晚餐：西部马华 + 老乡鸡。 西部马华的尖椒肉丝饭依然无敌的存在，辣度刚刚好。牛肉丝份量足，口感好。 今天的白切牛肉品质不好，明显放了一阵子都失水了，很干巴，口感都接近牛肉干了，提出批评。 #小泽吃饭联播#","body":"今日晚餐：西部马华 + 老乡鸡。\n\n西部马华的尖椒肉丝饭依然无敌的存在，辣度刚刚好。牛肉丝份量足，口感好。\n\n今天的白切牛肉品质不好，明显放了一阵子都失水了，很干巴，口感都接近牛肉干了，提出批评。\n\n#小泽吃饭联播#","url":"https://weibo.com/1906286443/Rs7Vvpd60","image":{"url":"media/weibo/0b76a50cd376accc.webp","width":1280,"height":1707},"published_at":"2026-11-19T18:38:17+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"weibo","handle":"1906286443","display_name":"钟文泽","media":[{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/0b76a50cd376accc.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx2.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij7onzz74ej22c0340kjm.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/304f372df3724683.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij7onyzfylj22c0340npe.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/b05414f982a01c07.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx2.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij7oo1xtmrj22c0340e82.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/1200bbf1734aa5fd.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij7oo3sarvj22c03401ky.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/0671a66c242863d2.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx4.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij7oo2xzy6j22c03401ky.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/b348b9d97548e55c.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx2.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij7onxwdgaj22c03407wi.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"media/weibo/0d151fa3da2d5080.webp","verified":true,"metrics":{"like":227,"reply":30,"repost":3}},"translated":false},{"id":"weibo-1906286443:5366671344403966","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"weibo-1906286443","source_name":"钟文泽","title":"","summary":"今日晚餐：南煎丸子 + 木须肉 + 芫爆肚丝。 肚丝虽然也好吃，但还是原版的羊百叶最好吃，可惜羊百叶在北京太贵了，猪肚丝比较经济一点。 一醉方休水是无糖小可乐。上边还印着世界杯特别款，明明世界杯结束才几个月，但感觉过去好久了。 #小泽吃饭联播#","body":"今日晚餐：南煎丸子 + 木须肉 + 芫爆肚丝。\n\n肚丝虽然也好吃，但还是原版的羊百叶最好吃，可惜羊百叶在北京太贵了，猪肚丝比较经济一点。\n\n一醉方休水是无糖小可乐。上边还印着世界杯特别款，明明世界杯结束才几个月，但感觉过去好久了。\n\n#小泽吃饭联播#","url":"https://weibo.com/1906286443/RrYqqitFI","image":{"url":"media/weibo/b779180958488538.webp","width":1280,"height":1707},"published_at":"2026-11-18T18:26:59+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"weibo","handle":"1906286443","display_name":"钟文泽","media":[{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/b779180958488538.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij6iougctzj22c0340b2a.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/129e92c84d52a04a.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx1.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij6iovk5u4j22c0340kjm.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/6c69ed9d7d1b9407.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx4.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij6iowg9eqj22c0340e82.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/1166d41a3f13d00d.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx1.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij6ioxehcxj22c03401ky.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/c6b4203a221a9190.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx1.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij6iotar32j22c03401ky.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/80d806f402af13f3.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij6ioylgnlj22c0340qv5.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"media/weibo/0d151fa3da2d5080.webp","verified":true,"metrics":{"like":377,"reply":51,"repost":4}},"translated":false},{"id":"weibo-1906286443:5366549444831032","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"weibo-1906286443","source_name":"钟文泽","title":"","summary":"《塞尔达传说：时之笛》 到手！ 我不太喜欢玩开放世界类游戏，听说这个版本会更线性，而且各大机构评分超高，就入手体验一下。 刷小红书有不少玩家还要买两盒，一盒用来玩，一盒要买烫金封面作为收藏。 还好我不是硬核玩家，不用追求收藏另外单买一盒了😅","body":"《塞尔达传说：时之笛》 到手！\n\n我不太喜欢玩开放世界类游戏，听说这个版本会更线性，而且各大机构评分超高，就入手体验一下。\n\n刷小红书有不少玩家还要买两盒，一盒用来玩，一盒要买烫金封面作为收藏。\n\n还好我不是硬核玩家，不用追求收藏另外单买一盒了😅","url":"https://weibo.com/1906286443/RrVfOkgLS","image":{"url":"media/weibo/4ab4b40ef934bd01.webp","width":1280,"height":1707},"published_at":"2026-11-18T10:22:36+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"weibo","handle":"1906286443","display_name":"钟文泽","media":[{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/4ab4b40ef934bd01.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx1.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bly1ij64q9klgmj22c0340qv5.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"media/weibo/0d151fa3da2d5080.webp","verified":true,"metrics":{"like":420,"reply":95,"repost":4}},"translated":false},{"id":"weibo-1906286443:5366301364586804","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"weibo-1906286443","source_name":"钟文泽","title":"","summary":"晚上简单吃。 我爸做了一个三文鱼两吃，一半刺身，一半香煎。不得不说三文鱼的油脂太细腻了，真的是美味。 我妈做了一个凉拌鸡丝黄瓜丝葱丝。 另外把中午做的韭菜盒子热了一下，我吃了 3 个，今天一共吃了 10 个韭菜盒子，也是刷新历史最好成绩了。 #小泽吃饭联播#","body":"晚上简单吃。\n\n我爸做了一个三文鱼两吃，一半刺身，一半香煎。不得不说三文鱼的油脂太细腻了，真的是美味。\n\n我妈做了一个凉拌鸡丝黄瓜丝葱丝。\n\n另外把中午做的韭菜盒子热了一下，我吃了 3 个，今天一共吃了 10 个韭菜盒子，也是刷新历史最好成绩了。\n\n#小泽吃饭联播#","url":"https://weibo.com/1906286443/RrONGjfeI","image":{"url":"media/weibo/bff7940f43896d68.webp","width":1280,"height":1707},"published_at":"2026-11-17T17:56:49+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"weibo","handle":"1906286443","display_name":"钟文泽","media":[{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/bff7940f43896d68.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx1.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bgy1ij5c9as1ycj22c0340e82.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/f14feb242b8341c5.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bgy1ij5c9d8mn3j22c0340kjm.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/333e6c83a7661bab.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bgy1ij5c9evmvgj22c03407wi.jpg"}],"quote":null,"avatar":"media/weibo/0d151fa3da2d5080.webp","verified":true,"metrics":{"like":498,"reply":70,"repost":4}},"translated":false},{"id":"weibo-1906286443:5366215259197023","kind":"post","channel":null,"source_id":"weibo-1906286443","source_name":"钟文泽","title":"","summary":"我爸我妈联合下厨，烙了一锅韭菜盒子。 借鉴了东方饺子王的思路，在韭菜盒子里加了虾仁提鲜，以及改善口感。 我发现家里的韭菜盒子面皮韧性更强，会有烙饼的口感，配合上满满馅料，吃的非常满足。 今天这顿我好像吃了六吃个，特别撑[允悲] #小泽吃饭联播#","body":"我爸我妈联合下厨，烙了一锅韭菜盒子。\n\n借鉴了东方饺子王的思路，在韭菜盒子里加了虾仁提鲜，以及改善口感。\n\n我发现家里的韭菜盒子面皮韧性更强，会有烙饼的口感，配合上满满馅料，吃的非常满足。\n\n今天这顿我好像吃了六吃个，特别撑[允悲]\n\n#小泽吃饭联播#","url":"https://weibo.com/1906286443/RrMyNCAz5","image":{"url":"media/weibo/495d0c53f1c9a828.webp","width":1280,"height":1707},"published_at":"2026-11-17T12:14:40+08:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T01:18:33+08:00","lang":"zh","blogger":{"platform":"weibo","handle":"1906286443","display_name":"钟文泽","media":[{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/495d0c53f1c9a828.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx1.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bgy1ij52d5o1bpj22c0340npe.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/03f939f75c0ba2d4.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx2.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bgy1ij52d779vej22c0340e83.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/c4cefad5f4e554f4.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bgy1ij52d49zyvj22c0340b2a.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/ce6a5821cae0e1ee.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bgy1ij52d8wepdj22c0340u0y.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/e29352a6b4e7d2d1.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx1.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bgy1ij52dbrhrlj22c0340npe.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/70337d076754ede5.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bgy1ij52degxe5j22c03401ky.jpg"},{"type":"image","url":"media/weibo/bc7317aba98b0008.webp","width":1280,"height":1707,"orig_url":"https://wx3.sinaimg.cn/large/719f9f6bgy1